# M3 hydration calibration (2026-10-20), thirst on only (thirst off ignores
# these keys). Evidence (round 2, build/m3-sweep-f7): with refuge the
# thirst-on extinction moved to Cheetah; even with change A it logs ~3300
# WATER_SUPPRESSED breeding decisions (mostly critical dehydration) against
# 139 conceptions, and starves (295 deaths vs 160 births). Base: the round-2
# candidate with the best thirst-off balance (12.39/12.94) and the latest
# thirst-on extinctions (Cheetah at 950/733).
base repro.conceiveWhileThirsty=1,predation.refugeCount=10,predation.lionSkillScale=1.5,predation.cheetahSkillScale=1.0,repro.predatorConceptionMultiplier=4
axis hydration.thirstyThreshold=50,60,70
axis hydration.criticalThreshold=20,30
axis hydration.baseDrain=0.16,0.24
axis hydration.predatorDrainMultiplier=0.8,1.1
